-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party model weights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The above BSD-3-Clause license applies to the cellcounter source code only.

This tool can use pretrained model weights from third parties:

- Cellpose pretrained models are trained on data under a CC-BY-NC
  (Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial) license. Any use of cellcounter
  with Cellpose weights, and any model fine-tuned from them, is therefore
  restricted to NON-COMMERCIAL research use.

- StarDist pretrained models carry their own upstream license terms.

cellcounter is intended for local, single-user, non-commercial research use.
